\"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"What can you automate with AI?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n              \"text\": \"Lead-outreach pipelines, competitive research and SEO/GEO pipelines, image-ad generation, custom CRMs and dashboards, and back-office workflows, built on a modern stack including Supabase, Vercel, Claude and GitHub.\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"How do we get started?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n              \"text\": \"Start a project and we map your repetitive work together, then design and build the agentic system that automates it and measure the productivity gain.\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n  </script>\n\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link\n    href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap\"\n    rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script type=\"module\" crossorigin src=\"/assets/index-BE7mlwOu.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin href=\"/assets/index-CYYM1UeV.css\">\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <div id=\"root\"></div>\n  <!-- Crawlable fallback for engines that don't execute JavaScript (incl. some AI crawlers) -->\n  <noscript>\n    <h1>David Geha - AI Consultant in Lebanon</h1>\n    <p>David Geha is an AI consultant in Lebanon who helps marketing agencies and F&amp;B businesses\n      automate repetitive work with custom agentic AI systems, including lead-outreach pipelines,\n      competitive research and SEO/GEO pipelines, image-ad generation, and custom CRM dashboards.</p>\n    <p>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:david@osgdev.com\">david@osgdev.com</a></p>\n  </noscript>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n",
  "is_spa": true,
  "extracted_text": "I'm David, a Civil & Environmental Engineering student at AUB running an AI consultancy for businesses across Lebanon. I work with marketing agencies and F&B teams to find the work they repeat every day and replace it with agentic AI systems that run on their own. Alongside that, I design and build the full product: UI/UX, backend, and apps.\n01\nFind the repetitive work\n02\nBuild the agentic system\n03\nAutomate & scale\nRecent Builds\nJUNE 2026\nAGENTICOUTREACHSUPABASE\nOutreach engine that sources leads, researches each one, and sends personalized cold emails on its own\nAPRIL 2026\nAIMARKETINGGPT IMAGE 2.0\nAd-creative pipeline generating on-brand UGC-style visuals, ready to export to Meta Ads\nMARCH 2026\nAIF&BAUTOMATION\nAutomated the daily reporting and inventory busywork for an F&B consultancy\nJANUARY 2026\nFULL STACKCRMSUPABASE\nCustom CRM built for a marketing agency to track clients, deals, and delivery\nNOVEMBER 2025\nUI/UXAPP\nDesigned and built a client-facing web app end to end, from UI to deploy\nSEPTEMBER 2025\nAGENTICWORKFLOW\nInternal agentic workflow that clears repetitive back-office tasks for a small team\nDavid Geha - AI Consultant in Lebanon\nDavid Geha is an AI consultant in Lebanon who helps marketing agencies and F&B businesses\nautomate repetitive work with custom agentic AI systems, including lead-outreach pipelines,\ncompetitive research and SEO/GEO pipelines, image-ad generation, and custom CRM dashboards.",
